# managed by arch-dotfiles/apparmor
# the two config files still links into the checkout (toggle-font rewrites them there): gtk.css and firefox's
# userChrome.css. apparmor checks a link's target, so a confined app reading them is refused there and falls back to
# the default theme; every other config is a real copy now
# installed into the desktop, fonts, qt and kde abstractions' .d hooks, so every gui profile gets it

  abi <abi/4.0>,

  owner @{HOME}/projects/arch-dotfiles/configs/desktop/{gtk/gtk.css,firefox/userChrome.css} r,

  include if exists <abstractions/dotfiles/config-links.d>
